## Verification Results

### 1. Strategy Evaluation Flow
```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Incoming Live Price Tick] --> B{Strategy Gating Rules}
    B -->|Pure ON_CLOSE| C{Is Candle Closed?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Evaluate Conditions]
    C -->|No| E[Abort / Standby]
    B -->|Pure INSTANT| D
    B -->|Mixed ON_CLOSE + INSTANT| D
    D --> F{All Rules Match?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Sniper Trade Triggered]
    F -->|No| H[No Action]
```

### 2. Execution Price Resolution
When a mixed strategy executes, it sends:
```json
{
  "symbol": "ETHUSDC",
  "direction": "LONG",
  "strategy_name": "Sniper_FVG_Mitigation",
  "current_price": 3120.25,
  "entry_price": 3120.25,
  "ipda_metrics": { ... }
}
```
The trades API handler (/api/trades) accepts `entry_price` directly, logging the trade at exactly `$3,120.25` rather than waiting for the candle close or calculating the midpoint consequent encroachment.
